<title>UK: GECC adds 100 mln rand to three-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC adds 100 mln rand to three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue, launched</p>
<p>earlier, has been doubled to 200 million rand from 100 million</p>
<p>rand, lead manager Hambros Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.0	MATURITY    07.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.65    PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIP     0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
